      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I posted it again in the canny, hopefully the right person will enable to develop a button to stop 2 factor authentication. It's a real nuisiance that if my little sister wants to log in to her account we constantly have to do 2 factor authentication.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
