  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-02-18T02:31:06.380Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We need a button to disable this in our vrchat menu settings. I understand the need for security and what not, but this thing is so annoying, every single time i have to fetch the codes, i want my life to be easier and not more difficult. Many applications simply have a disable/enable Two-Factor Authentication button. Let people choose for extra security if they want, but let there be an option to disable Two-Factor Authentication for people who just want to quickly  hop into Vrchat, there absolutely MUST be a button developed where you can enable or disable this. Many people agree that they don't want Two-Factor Authentication.",
